<title>UK: Huntleigh seeks share move to official list.</title>
<headline>Huntleigh seeks share move to official list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huntleigh Technology Plc said on Monday it was applying for its shares to be moved to the official list of the London Stock Exchange (LSE).</p>
<p>The healthcare products manufacturer, which currently has its shares traded on the Unlisted Securities Market (USM), said it anticipated dealings in its ordinary shares on the official list would start on November 4.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
